@baseUrl = http://localhost:5164
# Set accessToken privately in your HTTP client's environment; never store a token here.
@contractId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@invoiceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### BIL-001: Server-scoped stored invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### BIL-002: Stored snapshots, not repriced
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### CON-004: Stored rental invoices and late fees only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts/{{contractId}}/billing
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
